dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-arms\" title=\"Bearhide Arms - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9da825311bcf4ccc4c8a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-125.0px,456.0px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:-512px\"><i style=\"left:171.9px;top:-470.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:175.5px;top:-461.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:118.9px;top:-431.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:150.8px;top:-463.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:168.8px;top:-462.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:138.4px;top:-425.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:90.1px;top:-451.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:151.9px;top:-466.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:144.4px;top:-447.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:140.6px;top:-441.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:52.3px;top:-467.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:105.9px;top:-434.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:160.9px;top:-454.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:69.6px;top:-452.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:143.0px;top:-471.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:166.4px;top:-444.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:153.3px;top:-473.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:62.6px;top:-452.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:156.2px;top:-447.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:124.4px;top: